WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.070 line:79% align:center
We all want more order in our business:

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.560 line:79% align:center
to understand how much we earn,
how much we spend

3
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.260 line:79% align:center
and where we can grow.

4
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:14.790 line:79% align:center
SpendSplif is a modern financial tracking app
built for entrepreneurs and teams.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.990 line:79% align:center
Forget spreadsheets and confusing categories.

6
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.020 line:79% align:center
With SpendSplif, you see your financial path clearly:

7
00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:28.770 line:79% align:center
