all in one intuitive platform.

8
00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:33.830 line:79% align:center
Create categories.
Choose from presets or customize your own.

9
00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:40.070 line:79% align:center
Add storage locations
like office cash or a personal account.

10
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.400 line:79% align:center
Then simply log income and expenses.

11
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.350 line:79% align:center
The system calculates your balances
and shows where the money goes.

12
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.980 line:79% align:center
Want more? Connect your bank.

13
00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.460 line:79% align:center
SpendSplif will automatically fetch all transactions.

14
00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:59.390 line:79% align:center
Secure, fast and accurate.

15
00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.370 line:79% align:center
Every transaction can have a comment.

16
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:08.900 line:79% align:center
Every amount is visualised:
charts, shares and month-to-month comparisons.

17
00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:12.510 line:79% align:center
You don't just see how much, you see why.

18
00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:18.080 line:79% align:center
Working solo or in a team?
Assign roles and grant access.

19
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.720 line:79% align:center
Need a tax report? It's ready in a few clicks.

20
00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.900 line:79% align:center
Multi-currency support, Excel export,
financial goals

21
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.720 line:79% align:center
